{"id":"19ea095512403696","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits.md","title":"Theorem — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算","display":"Theorem — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits","aliases":["14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits"],"display":"Theorem — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算","source_ref":"Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.5, pp.39–40","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.5, pp.39–40"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,K\">\\(\\mathcal C,K\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:K\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(D:K\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为图表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_C:K\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(D_C:K\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 的对象值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(k)(C)\">\\(D(k)(C)\\)</span>，箭头值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(\\alpha)_C\">\\(D(\\alpha)_C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\">\\(L,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\)</span> 为候选顶点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,D(k))\">\\(\\pi\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,D(k))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(D(k),Q)\">\\(\\iota\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(D(k),Q)\\)</span> 为候选锥、余锥的自然变换族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_C=((\\pi_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\">\\(\\pi_C=((\\pi_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C=((\\iota_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\">\\(\\iota_C=((\\iota_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\)</span> 为其集合分量族；不预设它们满足锥方程。极限谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,\\pi,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(L(C),\\pi_C,D_C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,\\pi,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(L(C),\\pi_C,D_C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(Q,\\iota,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(Q(C),\\iota_C,D_C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(Q,\\iota,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(Q(C),\\iota_C,D_C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先逐点取集合极限。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:B\\to C\">\\(u:B\\to C\\)</span>，由图表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的自然性和集合极限泛性质唯一得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C)\\to L(B)\">\\(L(C)\\to L(B)\\)</span>；唯一性给出函子律，并使所有投影自然。对任意预层锥，其逐点因子映射也由同一唯一性满足自然性。这给出预层极限。余极限的构造完全对偶。反向由已构造的逐点（余）极限和范畴（余）极限的唯一同构得到，且同构保持给定锥分量。小性保证这些集合构造仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，Categorical Preliminaries, pp.22–23; I.5, pp.39–40。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,K$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$D:K\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 为图表。$D_C:K\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 的对象值为 $D(k)(C)$，箭头值为 $D(\\alpha)_C$。$L,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})$ 为候选顶点；$\\pi\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,D(k))$、$\\iota\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(D(k),Q)$ 为候选锥、余锥的自然变换族。$\\pi_C=((\\pi_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}$、$\\iota_C=((\\iota_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}$ 为其集合分量族；不预设它们满足锥方程。极限谓词见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"D:K\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"D_C:K\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"D(k)(C)","display":false},{"tex":"D(\\alpha)_C","display":false},{"tex":"L,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,D(k))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(D(k),Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_C=((\\pi_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_C=((\\iota_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,\\pi,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(L(C),\\pi_C,D_C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(Q,\\iota,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(Q(C),\\iota_C,D_C).","display":true},{"tex":"u:B\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"L(C)\\to L(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":2494,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits|thm-188 — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits|thm-188 — 预层的小极限与小余极限逐点计算]]"},{"id":"a15ef6697dd133a5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"717547fac08fc31f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["55bd5d1a324171ab","300365f146cacc8a"]}